---
import { siteUrl } from "../../../lib/routes.mjs";
---

<header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fenton indoor season · 2026</p>
    <h1>2026 acclimation calendar archive</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        The collection moved indoors and began a three-day equipment shakedown on Friday, July 31.
        This calendar preserves that earlier ramp and seasonal plan. The AW200 and new AeroLight 240
        W were hung September 13, with AW200 at 45% and AeroLight 240 W at 38%, and the owner
        applied the latest layout. The room end stays open. The owner confirms an 18-inch plant-tip
        reference and the same 13 h 15 m total cycle for both lights, including 15-minute sunrise
        and sunset transitions at the start and end. Exact clock times remain unrecorded; the clock
        events below are earlier planning references.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <button class="button" id="print" type="button">
            <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-print")} width="64" height="64"></use>
            </svg>
            Print calendar
        </button>
        <button
            class="button secondary"
            id="empty-days-toggle"
            type="button"
            aria-controls="months"
            aria-pressed="false"
        >
            <svg
                id="empty-days-icon"
                class="site-icon"
                viewBox="0 0 64 64"
                aria-hidden="true"
                focusable="false"
            >
                <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-eye-off")} width="64" height="64"></use>
            </svg>
            <span id="empty-days-label">Hide empty days</span>
        </button>
        <button class="button secondary" id="reset" type="button">
            <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-reset")} width="64" height="64"></use>
            </svg>
            Clear checkmarks
        </button>
        <span class="hero-stat">
            <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-light")} width="64" height="64"></use>
            </svg>
            Light 8 a.m.–8 p.m. during the ramp
        </span>
        <span class="hero-stat">
            <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-airflow")} width="64" height="64"></use>
            </svg>
            Fan 8:15 a.m.–7:45 p.m.
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="live-dashboard" aria-label="Earlier Fenton plan with the current local clock">
        <div class="live-block">
            <span class="live-label">
                <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-clock")} width="64" height="64"></use>
                </svg>
                Fenton time
            </span>
            <time class="live-clock" id="live-clock">
                --:--:--
            </time>
            <span class="live-date" id="live-date">
                Loading local time…
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="live-block">
            <span class="live-label">
                <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <use
                        href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-calendar")}
                        width="64"
                        height="64"
                    ></use>
                </svg>
                Next in the earlier plan
            </span>
            <strong class="next-event-title" id="next-event-title">
                Loading schedule…
            </strong>
            <span class="next-event-time">
                <time id="next-event-time"></time>
                <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
                <span class="countdown" id="countdown"></span>
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="live-block">
            <span class="live-label">
                <svg class="site-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <use href={siteUrl("plant-icons.svg#icon-growth")} width="64" height="64"></use>
                </svg>
                Earlier ramp progress
            </span>
            <div class="progress-heading">
                <span id="progress-stage">Three-day shakedown</span>
                <span id="progress-percent">0%</span>
            </div>
            <div
                class="progress-track"
                id="ramp-progress"
                role="progressbar"
                aria-label="Acclimation ramp progress"
                aria-valuemin="0"
                aria-valuemax="100"
                aria-valuenow="0"
            >
                <span class="progress-bar" id="progress-bar"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="progress-caption" id="progress-caption">
                Ramp begins August 3.
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
